    "10fbd9:Skyrim.esm": { "out": "db8a2:Skyrim.esm", "name": "Dwarven Metal Ingot", "type": "MISC", "makes": 1, "owner": "", "half": "", "race": "", "rank": "", "family": "", "nobody": "duplicate Dwarven Metal Ingot scrap smelt. One scrap path stays (RecipeIngotDwarvenScrapPlateMetalLarge). The other five are hidden from the smelter menu in Thornswood-Content.esp and refused here so the gate matches the menu. No sale price. People sell to each other." },
